---
// HowItWorksSection.astro - Clean 3-Step Effortless Onboarding Timeline
---

<section class="section section-subtle how-it-works-section" id="howItWorks">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-clean">
      <h2>
        Get Protected in Under 48 Hours
      </h2>
      <p>
        We handle all technical gateway routing, underwriting, and migration in the background so your store never experiences a second of payment downtime.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-steps">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-card-row">
        <div class="step-text-col">
          <h3 class="step-heading">Submit Your 60-Second Analysis Request</h3>
          <p class="step-paragraph">
            Provide your estimated monthly volume and current processor, or upload a recent processing statement. No long-term contracts, zero obligation, and complete confidentiality.
          </p>
          <div class="step-perks">
            <span>⚡ 60-second simple form</span>
            <span>🔒 256-bit bank-level encryption</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-col">
          <div class="step-image-box">
            <img 
              src="/images/card_checkout.jpg" 
              alt="Step 1: Simple 60-second processing review submission" 
              class="step-photo"
              loading="lazy"
              width="540"
              height="340"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-card-row reverse-layout">
        <div class="step-text-col">
          <h3 class="step-heading">Receive Your Custom Rate & Redundancy Audit</h3>
          <p class="step-paragraph">
            A Senior Payment Specialist conducts a line-by-line statement review. We show you exact fee markup reductions and map out your optimal multi-gateway failover routing.
          </p>
          <div class="step-perks">
            <span>📊 Itemized line-by-line fee comparison</span>
            <span>🛡️ Tailored chargeback & high-risk defense plan</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-col">
          <div class="step-image-box">
            <img 
              src="/images/pos_terminal.jpg" 
              alt="Step 2: Custom statement audit and gateway strategy" 
              class="step-photo"
              loading="lazy"
              width="540"
              height="340"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-card-row">
        <div class="step-text-col">
          <h3 class="step-heading">Switch in 24–48 Hours & Keep More Cash</h3>
          <p class="step-paragraph">
            Your new merchant account goes live with custom pre-underwriting. Your old processor stays active until you are 100% verified, ensuring zero payment disruption. Next-day deposits land directly in your account.
          </p>
          <div class="step-perks">
            <span>🚀 0 seconds of store downtime</span>
            <span>💰 Next business day cash deposits</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-col">
          <div class="step-image-box">
            <img 
              src="/images/merchant_success.jpg" 
              alt="Step 3: Confident merchant enjoying next-day deposits and lower rates" 
              class="step-photo"
              loading="lazy"
              width="540"
              height="340"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .timeline-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .step-card-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .reverse-layout {
    direction: rtl;
  }

  .reverse-layout > * {
    direction: ltr;
  }

  .step-text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-counter {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--indigo-bg);
    color: var(--indigo-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--indigo-border);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .step-cyan-pill {
    background: var(--cyan-bg);
    color: var(--cyan-primary);
    border-color: var(--cyan-border);
  }

  .step-emerald-pill {
    background: var(--emerald-bg);
    color: var(--emerald-primary);
    border-color: var(--emerald-border);
  }

  .step-heading {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-paragraph {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-perks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  .step-image-box {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .step-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 280px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .step-card-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }

    .reverse-layout {
      direction: ltr;
    }

    .step-photo {
      height: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
